    "question": "x এর মান কত হলে $x\\over ln x$ এর মান ক্ষুদ্রতম হবে?",
    "options": [
      "$1\\over e$",
      "e",
      "-$1\\over e$",
      "-e"
    ],
    "answer": "e",
    "explanation": "<p>ধরি,$ f(x)=\\frac{x}{\\ln x} $</p><p>$ \\therefore f^{\\prime}(x)=\\frac{\\ln x \\cdot \\frac{d}{d x}(x)-x \\frac{d}{d x}(\\ln x)}{(\\ln x)^2}=\\frac{\\ln x-1}{(\\ln x)^2}$</p><p>শর্তমতে, $ f^{\\prime}(x)=0 \\Rightarrow \\frac{\\ln x-1}{(\\ln x)^2}=0 \\Rightarrow \\ln x-1=0$</p><p>$ \\Rightarrow \\ln x=1 \\Rightarrow \\ln x=\\ln \\therefore x=e$</p>"
  },
